<LegalLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Zander Tran"
  description="Privacy Policy for ZanderTran.com. How Zander Tran collects, uses, and protects your information."
  path="/privacy-policy"
  heading="Privacy Policy"
  effectiveDate="March 3, 2026"
>
  <p>This Privacy Policy explains how Zander Tran ("I," "me," or "my") collects, uses, and protects your information when you visit ZanderTran.com and interact with my content, newsletter, courses, and community.</p>

  <p>By using this website, you agree to the practices described in this policy.</p>

  <h2>What Information I Collect</h2>

  <p><strong>Information you provide directly:</strong> When you subscribe to The Invisible Expert newsletter, register for the Visible in 5 Challenge, purchase a course, or contact me, I collect your name and email address. If you make a purchase, payment information is collected and processed by third-party payment processors. I do not store your credit card details.</p>

  <p><strong>Information collected automatically:</strong> When you visit this site, standard web technology automatically collects certain information including your IP address, browser type, device type, pages visited, and time spent on pages. This is collected through Google Analytics.</p>

  <h2>How I Use Your Information</h2>

  <p>I use your information to:</p>

  <ul>
    <li>Send The Invisible Expert newsletter (every Tuesday)</li>
    <li>Deliver course content, challenge materials, and resources you have purchased or opted into</li>
    <li>Send transactional emails related to your purchases</li>
    <li>Respond to your questions and support requests</li>
    <li>Improve this website and its content</li>
    <li>Analyze traffic and reader behavior in aggregate</li>
  </ul>

  <p>I do not sell, rent, or trade your personal information to third parties.</p>

  <h2>Email and Marketing Communications</h2>

  <p>When you subscribe to my newsletter or opt into any free resource, you are consenting to receive email communications from me via GoHighLevel (GHL), my email and CRM platform. Every email I send includes an unsubscribe link. You may opt out at any time and I will remove you promptly.</p>

  <h2>Third-Party Services</h2>

  <p>This website and my business operations use the following third-party services, each with their own privacy policies:</p>

  <ul>
    <li><strong>GoHighLevel (GHL)</strong>: email, CRM, funnels, and course delivery</li>
    <li><strong>Course Sprout</strong>: course hosting and delivery</li>
    <li><strong>Pinball Community</strong>: community platform</li>
    <li><strong>Google Analytics</strong>: website traffic analysis</li>
    <li><strong>Google Search Console</strong>: website performance monitoring</li>
    <li><strong>Vercel / GitHub</strong>: website hosting and deployment</li>
    <li><strong>Stripe and payment processors</strong>: payment processing for courses and challenge</li>
  </ul>

  <p>I may include affiliate links in my content for tools I use and recommend, including HeyGen, ElevenLabs, and GHL. If you click an affiliate link and make a purchase, I may earn a commission at no additional cost to you. I only recommend tools I personally use.</p>

  <h2>Cookies</h2>

  <p>This website uses cookies (small text files stored on your device) to enable site functionality, remember your preferences, and analyze traffic through Google Analytics. You may disable cookies in your browser settings, though some site features may not function correctly as a result.</p>

  <h2>Data Storage and Security</h2>

  <p>Your data is stored on servers maintained by Vercel and GoHighLevel. I take reasonable steps to protect your information, but no method of internet transmission is 100% secure. I cannot guarantee absolute security.</p>

  <h2>Your Rights</h2>

  <p>Depending on where you live, you may have the right to access, correct, or delete your personal data. To make any such request, contact me at the email address below and I will respond within 30 days.</p>

  <p>If you are located in the European Union, you have additional rights under GDPR. If you are a California resident, you have additional rights under CCPA. Please contact me directly to exercise any of these rights.</p>

  <h2>Children's Privacy</h2>

  <p>This website is intended for adults. I do not knowingly collect personal information from anyone under the age of 16. If you believe a minor has submitted information to me, please contact me immediately.</p>

  <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>

  <p>I may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. When I do, I will update the Effective Date at the top of this page. Continued use of this website after any changes constitutes your acceptance of the updated policy.</p>

  <hr />

  <h2>Contact</h2>

  <p>If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact me at:</p>

  <div class="contact-block">
    <p><strong>Zander Tran</strong></p>
    <p>ZanderTran.com</p>
    <p>Email: <a href="mailto:support@zandertran.com">support@zandertran.com</a></p>
    <p>Chiang Mai, Thailand</p>
  </div>
</LegalLayout>
